      "uid": "zhcn:1ce2826e04c7cbee67ceedec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕律动在观众席的角落里，\n安静地睡着了。\n既然她在这里，那就意味着——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5c82d5e6e21b8a80d883e99413cfa4cc8cc8bfa39ca3c04ee55c6f9530ab053",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118113.json",
